{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15540","headline":"赋得御园芳草 · 陆贽","name":"赋得御园芳草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴阴御园里，瑶草日光长。\n靃靡含烟雾，依稀带夕阳。\n雨余荑更密，风暖蕙初香。\n拥仗缘驰道，乘舆入建章。\n湿烟摇不散，细影乱无行。\n恒恐韶光晚，何人辨早芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆贽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}